    "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390160/extras/3a05cd23c403df652caebb8bead2bb05.avif?t=1755004848\" data-has-big width=1600 height=1822 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Special Offer</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390160/extras/8407b897a68d6f0468e28fae70d72256.avif?t=1755004848\" width=1232 height=400 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>READY TO RUN YOUR OWN PUB?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of <i>The Pub Life Simulator</i> and turn a small, rundown space into the bar of your dreams. Serve great drinks, keep your guests satisfied, and grow your business through smart decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390160/extras/fdbeadd3a475626206c85d797560d46f.poster.avif?t=1755004848\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390160/extras/fdbeadd3a475626206c85d797560d46f.webm?t=1755004848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390160/extras/fdbeadd3a475626206c85d797560d46f.mp4?t=1755004848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>START FRESH, CLEAN UP, AND OPEN YOUR PUB</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your first task is to tidy up the place. A clean and welcoming environment is key to attracting customers. Spend your initial budget wisely buy essential supplies and kick things off with a simple menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390160/extras/0ae2e8301f848149fa55f8319b6e9a92.poster.avif?t=1755004848\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390160/extras/0ae2e8301f848149fa55f8319b6e9a92.webm?t=1755004848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390160/extras/0ae2e8301f848149fa55f8319b6e9a92.mp4?t=1755004848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPAND YOUR MENU AND MASTER YOUR CRAFT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, unlock new ingredients, master recipes, and create drinks your guests will love. Experiment with different styles, develop your signature touch, and leave your mark on the neighborhood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390160/extras/cf9f6e848bb26e0a86919e4221611d2c.poster.avif?t=1755004848\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390160/extras/cf9f6e848bb26e0a86919e4221611d2c.webm?t=1755004848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390160/extras/cf9f6e848bb26e0a86919e4221611d2c.mp4?t=1755004848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BALANCE IS EVERYTHING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Running a successful pub isn\u2019t just about pouring drinks. Manage your stock, keep an eye on expenses, and respond to customer demands. Invest wisely bad decisions can put your business at risk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390160/extras/e1a06817b2ddbb75b726282d1d222ecb.poster.avif?t=1755004848\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390160/extras/e1a06817b2ddbb75b726282d1d222ecb.webm?t=1755004848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390160/extras/e1a06817b2ddbb75b726282d1d222ecb.mp4?t=1755004848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AN IMMERSIVE PUB MANAGEMENT EXPERIENCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its deep management system, evolving gameplay, and realistic pub-building mechanics, <i>The Pub Life Simulator</i> offers a truly satisfying journey. Transform dust into charm, and build the pub you've always dreamed of become the heart of your neighborhood!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390160/extras/0ace613723e55b207079d1da7123e007.poster.avif?t=1755004848\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390160/extras/0ace613723e55b207079d1da7123e007.webm?t=1755004848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390160/extras/0ace613723e55b207079d1da7123e007.mp4?t=1755004848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ADD TO YOUR WISHLIST NOW!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no limit to how far you can go. Build your dream pub, become the local favorite, and rise to the top of the bar scene.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't miss this realistic pub management sim Wishlist <i>The Pub Life Simulator</i> now and be among the first to play!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>READY TO RUN YOUR OWN PUB?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of <i>The Pub Life Simulator</i> and turn a small, rundown space into the bar of your dreams. Serve great drinks, keep your guests satisfied, and grow your business through smart decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390160/extras/fdbeadd3a475626206c85d797560d46f.poster.avif?t=1755004848\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390160/extras/fdbeadd3a475626206c85d797560d46f.webm?t=1755004848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390160/extras/fdbeadd3a475626206c85d797560d46f.mp4?t=1755004848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>START FRESH, CLEAN UP, AND OPEN YOUR PUB</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your first task is to tidy up the place. A clean and welcoming environment is key to attracting customers. Spend your initial budget wisely buy essential supplies and kick things off with a simple menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390160/extras/0ae2e8301f848149fa55f8319b6e9a92.poster.avif?t=1755004848\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390160/extras/0ae2e8301f848149fa55f8319b6e9a92.webm?t=1755004848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390160/extras/0ae2e8301f848149fa55f8319b6e9a92.mp4?t=1755004848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPAND YOUR MENU AND MASTER YOUR CRAFT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, unlock new ingredients, master recipes, and create drinks your guests will love. Experiment with different styles, develop your signature touch, and leave your mark on the neighborhood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390160/extras/cf9f6e848bb26e0a86919e4221611d2c.poster.avif?t=1755004848\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390160/extras/cf9f6e848bb26e0a86919e4221611d2c.webm?t=1755004848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390160/extras/cf9f6e848bb26e0a86919e4221611d2c.mp4?t=1755004848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BALANCE IS EVERYTHING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Running a successful pub isn\u2019t just about pouring drinks. Manage your stock, keep an eye on expenses, and respond to customer demands. Invest wisely bad decisions can put your business at risk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390160/extras/e1a06817b2ddbb75b726282d1d222ecb.poster.avif?t=1755004848\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390160/extras/e1a06817b2ddbb75b726282d1d222ecb.webm?t=1755004848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390160/extras/e1a06817b2ddbb75b726282d1d222ecb.mp4?t=1755004848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AN IMMERSIVE PUB MANAGEMENT EXPERIENCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its deep management system,